### Notes on "Unclear" Items

**Commits 63+64 (12d01d896e + bdcb3a73e6)**: A BSD console macros build fix was added (bdcb3a73e6) then reverted (12d01d896e) because it broke something on 25.0. The revert message says "drop async-flip & virtual-GPU helpers from 25.0 backport" but actually reverts the BSD macros. This pair should be investigated if BSD builds are a target for 25.0 — but since both the fix and its revert are in the history, the net effect on current 25.0 is **no change from the stable tag**.

