The release/25.0 branch since xlibre-xserver-25.0.0.25 contains **exclusively bugfixes and security hardening**. Every commit addresses a concrete issue (UAF, buffer overflow, NULL deref, integer overflow, memory leak, double-free, protocol validation, etc.) without introducing new features or risky refactorings.

